// The family each class of held item falls back to (docs/holding.md section 2, D459): a pair
// of hands plays `<class>.<stance>`, else `<family>.<stance>`, else the stance's generic set
// (`one_hand.single`), so a new class plays before its own clips exist. The families are
// blade, blunt, polearm and heavy; a class is added here when its first item is.
{
    "sword": "blade",
}
